dialogue cityruins_party_talk
title: The council in the archive
trigger: ThemeStart cityruins
speaker commander $commander
speaker trusted $trusted
speaker innkeeper - name=Innkeeper portrait=pandagirl

node a commander
  The archive woke for me. A council, a vote, a row of commanders. One of those faces was mine.
  -> b

node b innkeeper
  The witch read it while you stared. Halcyon couldn't stop the Manalith, so it fed it to sleep and drank what spilled. Every scrap of mana in us is the Manalith's. And you were in that room. I'm still deciding what I think of that.
  * And you? You saw that face as well. -> speak
    if: TrustAtLeast $trusted 25
  * Take the time you need. I'm still deciding too.

node speak trusted
  I've decided. A face on a wall is who you were. I've watched who you are. If that council made you, you've spent every day since unmaking it. I'll stand with the one I've watched.
  * Then watch me closely. If I start turning into that face, stop me. -> stop
    do: AddTrust $trusted 6
  * Thank you. That's more than I'd give myself today. -> thank
    do: AddTrust $trusted 4

node stop trusted
  I'll stop you. Then I'll drag you back to the fire and we'll talk.

node thank trusted
  Then take mine until you can give it yourself.
